column18:
2021 Sarpanch runner-up by 38 votes;
Secretary, Sohagra Mandir Trust;
Founder, Lok Tarang Foundation Trust;
Adhyaksh, Rashtriya Kalakar Association;
Gorakhpur Mandal Mahasachiv, JDU.

- Former Zila Parishad (2011).
- Incumbent Defacto ZP contested (2nd runner up, 7239)
-In 2006 contested for Zila Parishad but lost due to 11 votes;
-In 2011 contested for Zila Parishad and won
-In 2016 not contested -Former Zila Mahasachiv of JDU;
-Former Zila Adhyaksh of EBC(JDU).

Former Loksabha Contestant; 
Incumbent Jan Suraaj District Vice President; 
Independent LS Contestant Madhubani 2024 (4623 Votes); Dentist; Conducting Free Dental Checkup Monthly

-  Two-term Defacto Sarpanch; 
- Former Mukhiya;
-  Ex Zila Sachiv & Vice Adhyaksh (SC Cell), Janata Dal (United)
- Zila Secretary, Malik Vikash Kendra.

Victor Jha | 47 | Brahmin | General | Brahmin | Former MP Candidate

- Former MP candidate from AAP  2014 Lok Sabha Contestant Katihar received 5,200 votes; 
- Founder Member of India Against Corruption. President of Bihar, Jharkhand; 
- Punarwas sangarhash samiti Sansthapak Sadayas
